  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "過身"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "王一如<br />\n<br />\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.8652268815785646\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">如來佛祖ê手印 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">踮guán ê額頭 畫出有牽挽ê皺痕</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Suah害guán頭殼gông-gông 跤手浮浮buē清彩</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Theⁿ tī紅眠床頂</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Píng來píng去 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Píng buē出khiau-ku孤獨ê夢境</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">少年ê手骨hō͘穡頭khè kah焦pô͘</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歲頭ê蛀蟲將面皮tshńg kah皺phè-phè</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tshāi踮</span><a href=\"http://down/\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">虛華</span></a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">ê世界走揣沓沓仔phàng見ê記持</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kioh我不止仔慌狂</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b><br />\n<a name='more'></a><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.8652268815785646\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">青春ê芳味 <br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">幸福ê記持 &nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;親像夠分ê紅りんご </span><a href=\"http://down/\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></a><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">想beh tī tit-beh lian-pó͘ ê樹枝 &nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;Koh做淡薄仔停留</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一下失覺察</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">跋落tī滄桑ê古早</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Guán tuì天公伯--à 古ló͘-so̍k古ê牽教</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">吐出</span><br /><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-indent: 12pt;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">最後一喙beh死nā-hāiⁿ ê khuì絲仔</span></div>\n<span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">翻輾轉　 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">佛祖致蔭ê樂聲</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kâm囝兒序細m̄甘ê huah-hiu</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">勻勻仔將guán sak uì奈何橋</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">橋跤 &nbsp;ka̍h-ka̍h滾ê</span><a href=\"http://down/\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">海湧</span></a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">聲</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Buē輸八音鼓吹pûn ta̍h-ti</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Hò͘走guán規身軀ê寒騷</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">幫贊guán接suà行ê跤步</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">飄撇ê過往 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;火化做燒lō ê手尾字</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">浪漫ê相思 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;灌風衝破烏雲飛上天</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tsit時tsūn &nbsp;tsiah知影</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">過身不而過是出世ê開始</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">無咱所想--ê hiah-nī</span><a href=\"http://down/\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">生驚</span></a><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">壁堵ê相片是guán在生ê記號</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">香火興旺是囝孫仔ê siàu念</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一世人ê骨力</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">勼做坐踮tī烏絲絨ê黃</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 13px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（hông）</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">金甕仔內</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">神主牌仔 &nbsp;是guán唯一ê圖騰</span><br /><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">平安喜樂 &nbsp;是服祀我ê牲禮</span></b>"
  },
